<title>INDIA: India's RBI sets 4.9 pct interest at repos auction.</title>
<headline>India's RBI sets 4.9 pct interest at repos auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set a cut-off interest of 4.90 percent at a repos auction on Wednesday, down from 5.0 percent at the last auction.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it accepted 41 bids for 35.38 billon rupees out of 72 bids received for 67.43 billion.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off price was 4.7349 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
